# Lethe prompt templates. Empty, and intended to stay that way.
#
# Lethe consults no model. Templating is corpus-driven - variability measured
# across a window rather than matched against a pattern list - and novelty is
# surprise-tested, so an absence is only a finding when exp(-expected) falls
# under significance.
#
# The directory exists because tests/unit/test_repo_structure.py requires every
# agent to ship one.
#
# Phase: 2 - Orchestrator & Investigation Flow
